  "render_image": {
    "_comment": "THE BROWSER THAT RENDERS THE DELIVERABLE, pinned like every other executable here. It was the one exception: Chromium came from `playwright install` and the text-shaping stack from whatever the machine had -- fontconfig and FreeType on Linux, CoreText on macOS. Identical HTML then rendered one page on a laptop and two on a runner, and four fixes inside the sheet all missed, because the unpinned thing was the renderer rather than the document. THE amd64 MANIFEST DIGEST, NOT THE INDEX: an index resolves to arm64 here and amd64 on a runner, which is the same divergence in a new hat.",
